<!--
    ============================================================
    KernelExtensions ProxyKiller 配置示例
    KernelExtensions ProxyKiller Configuration Example
    ============================================================
    定位：一个**常驻的加速器** —— 加速所有正在过载的 Shell，让代理更快瘫痪。
    What it is: a resident accelerator that speeds up every Shell already overloading a
    proxy, so the proxy goes down sooner.
    放 <扩展根>/ProxyKiller/ 下。
    Place it under <extensionRoot>/ProxyKiller/.

    启用方式：给玩家挂上存档 flag ProxyKiller_<文件名>（不含 .xml）。
    flag 就是"入口牌"：无 flag 程序锁定；出现多个 flag 视为作者配置错误（锁定 + 日志报错）。
    然后在终端执行 #PROXYKILLER#。
    How to enable: set the save flag ProxyKiller_<fileName> (without .xml) on the player.
    The flag is the entry token: none means locked; more than one is an authoring error.
    Then run #PROXYKILLER# in the terminal.

    ⚠️ 默认情况下它**自己不瘫痪任何代理**。
    By default it never overloads a proxy itself.
    原版把代理过载做成 Shell 的一个状态（原版 shell 程序的 Overload 按钮），
    而 Shell 需要目标机 admin 才能开 —— 那道门槛本程序不去拆。
    所以默认：目标机上没有开着的 shell 在过载时，它只是占着内存跑动画，什么也不影响。
    Vanilla makes proxy overload a state of the Shell, and a Shell needs admin on the target.
    That gate is left intact: by default, with no Shell overloading, this program just holds
    RAM and animates; it changes nothing.
    它只让"玩家已经在做的事"更快：N 个 shell 的总过载速率 = N × 倍速。
    It only makes what the player is already doing faster: N shells give N x the multiplier.

    ★ 本程序也可以**自己过载代理**（<SelfOverload>），此时不再需要 shell，
      因此**不依赖目标机的管理员权限** —— 原版里"过载代理"本身就没有权限门槛，
      门槛只在"运行 shell"上，所以这不是拆护栏，而是补一个原版缺失的手段。
    ★ It can also overload the proxy **by itself** (<SelfOverload>). That needs no Shell and
      therefore no admin on the target: in vanilla, overloading a proxy has no permission gate
      of its own — only running a Shell does. So this is not removing a guard rail, it fills in
      a means vanilla never provided.

    运行时长由三项决定：跟随连接（<FollowConnection>）、过载完成自动关闭
    （<AutoCloseOnOverload>）、以及玩家自己按 Exit。
    前三项都不写时是**常驻**（既有行为）。
    How long it runs is decided by <FollowConnection>, <AutoCloseOnOverload>, or the player's
    Exit button. With all of them unset the program is **resident** (the previous behaviour).

    ⚠️ 同一时间只能有一个实例（重复执行会被拒绝）：它常驻且副作用是全局的，
    两个实例会让同一个 shell 被削两次。
    Only one instance may run at a time (a second launch is rejected): it is resident and its
    effect is global, so two instances would tick the same Shell twice.
-->
<ProxyKillerConfig>

  <!-- ── 程序名 / Program name ──
       终端与窗口顶部显示的名字。留空 = ProxyKiller。
       Name shown in the terminal and the window title. Empty = ProxyKiller.
       程序在终端里的注册名 #PROXYKILLER# 不受此处影响。
       The registration name #PROXYKILLER# is not affected by this. -->
  <ProgramName>ProxyKiller</ProgramName>

  <!-- ── RAM 占用 / RAM usage ──
       起始固定 50MB（不可配），以 <RampRate> 的速率爬升到 <BurstTarget>，之后一直占着。
       Starts at a fixed 50MB (not configurable) and ramps at <RampRate> up to <BurstTarget>,
       then holds it.
       这个爬升不是装饰 —— 它同时驱动界面（粒子由混沌趋于整齐）**和加速倍速**。
       That ramp is not decoration: it drives both the visuals (the dots settle as it climbs)
       and the acceleration multiplier.

       BurstTarget：RAM 爬升目标（MB）。留空 = 100。
                    Ramp target in MB. Empty = 100.
       RampRate   ：RAM 爬升速率（MB/s）。留空 = 200（与原版一致）。
                    Ramp speed in MB/s. Empty = 200 (same as vanilla).
                    它同时决定"粒子由乱到稳"和"倍速从 1 爬到目标值"的时长（两者共用同一进度）。
                    默认 200 时 50 → 100 只要 0.25 秒，形同瞬间 —— 想看清爬升过程就调小它
                    （例如 8 ≈ 6.25 秒），不必去动 BurstTarget。写 0 = 停在起始值不爬。
                    It sets the duration of both the visual settle and the multiplier ramp.
                    At 200, 50 -> 100 takes 0.25s, i.e. instant; lower it to watch the ramp
                    (8 gives about 6.25s) instead of raising BurstTarget. 0 means no ramp. -->
  <BurstTarget>100</BurstTarget>
  <RampRate>200</RampRate>

  <!-- ── shell 过载倍速 / Shell overload multiplier ──
       倍速由 RAM 爬升**线性驱动**：倍速 1 → ShellOverloadTarget 对应 50MB → BurstTarget
       （两者共用同一个进度，所以"占的内存越多、加速越强"能互相印证）。
       The multiplier is driven linearly by the RAM ramp: speed 1 -> ShellOverloadTarget
       corresponds to 50MB -> BurstTarget.
       1.0 = 原版过载速度（不加速）；2.0 = 两倍。留空 = 1.0。
       1.0 = vanilla overload speed; 2.0 = double. Empty = 1.0.
       倍速峰值恰好等于这里填的值（RAM 爬满那一刻）；爬满之后一直保持。
       The peak multiplier equals this value (reached when RAM tops out), and holds there.
       只影响**正在过载的** shell；空闲的 shell 不会被碰（否则它下次真的去过载时会从
       负数起跑，等于把代理直接归零 —— 那是秒杀，不是加速）。
       Only shells that are actually overloading are touched. Idle shells are left alone:
       otherwise the next overload they start would begin below zero, which would zero the
       proxy outright instead of speeding it up. -->
  <ShellOverloadTarget>2.0</ShellOverloadTarget>

  <!-- ── 自己过载代理 / Self-overload ──
       留空 / 0（含任意负数）= **不主动过载**（默认，保持既有行为）。
       Empty / 0 (or any negative) = no self-overload (default, previous behaviour).

       填了有效值（0 < x ≤ 1）时：本程序**不用 shell 也能削减目标节点的代理过载进度**，
       速率 = x 倍原版单个 shell。1 = 与原版一个 shell 同速。
       With a valid value (0 < x <= 1) the program reduces the watched node's proxy overload
       progress **without any Shell**, at x times the rate of one vanilla Shell. 1 = same as one.

       速率同样由 RAM 爬升**线性驱动**：0 → SelfOverload 对应 50MB → BurstTarget
       （与倍速共用同一个进度）—— 所以你调的是"给多少内存"，两个能力一起涨。
       The rate is driven by the same RAM ramp: 0 -> SelfOverload across 50MB -> BurstTarget.
       You tune "how much memory", and both abilities grow together.

       ⚠️ 有效时**强制跟随连接**（<FollowConnection> 会被忽略并记一条 Warn）：
       过载会持续触发目标机的敌对行为（起 trace），不跟随的话就是跑到哪打到哪。
       ⚠️ When active it **forces follow-the-connection** (<FollowConnection> is ignored with a
       warning): overloading keeps triggering the target's hostile response (trace), so not
       following would mean "shoot wherever you go".

       ⚠️ 如果同一扩展里还有 PortHackV2 的 <RequireProxyOverload>，开了本项会让那个前置
       直接被满足 —— 要一起用就靠 flag 或其它前置把它门控住。
       ⚠️ If the same extension also uses PortHackV2's <RequireProxyOverload>, enabling this
       satisfies that prerequisite for free — gate them apart with flags if that matters. -->
  <SelfOverload>0</SelfOverload>

  <!-- ── 运行时长 / How long it runs ──
       FollowConnection：true = 玩家离开**启动时所在的节点**就自动关闭。
                         留空 = false = 常驻（默认，既有行为）。
                         true = close once the player leaves the node it was started on.
                         Empty = false = resident (default, previous behaviour).
       AutoCloseOnOverload：所盯节点的代理由"生效"变"已瘫痪"后自动关闭。
                         留空 = false。
                         所盯节点 = 跟随连接时是**当前所连节点**，否则是启动时所在节点。
                         Close once the watched node's proxy goes from active to down.
                         Empty = false. The watched node is the currently connected one when
                         following, otherwise the node it was started on.
                         实现上要求**先见到过它生效**，否则刚开时一个本来就没代理（或代理
                         已瘫痪）的节点会被立刻判为"完成"而秒关。
                         It must first have seen the proxy active, otherwise a node whose proxy
                         was already down would close the program immediately. -->
  <FollowConnection>false</FollowConnection>
  <AutoCloseOnOverload>false</AutoCloseOnOverload>

  <!-- ── 背景：上升数据流 / Background: rising data stream ──
       一串串粒子从底部向上飞出去，每颗后面拖一条与速度成正比的尾巴。
       Particles fly upward out of the top, each trailing a line proportional to its speed.

       它**随 RAM 爬升而加速** —— 这就是"过载"在背景上的表达：
       占的内存越多，数据冲得越快、尾巴越长。
       It **accelerates with the RAM ramp**: the more memory it holds, the faster the data
       streams and the longer the trails — that is how "overload" is shown.

       密度与速度都是幂律（数量/速度 ≈ 系数 × 高度^0.5），但这里**不用填系数** ——
       填"某个基准尺寸下你要多少、多快"，程序自己反解系数。
       Density and speed are both power laws, but you do not fill in coefficients: just say
       what you want at some reference size and the program solves for them.

       BackgroundColor          粒子与拖尾的颜色。**auto / 留空 / NONE = 主题高亮色**
                                （跟着主题走，不写死白色）；也可写 CustomColor 预设名与动态色
                                （LDTchara / Rainbow / Gradient:…）以及 hex / 数值 / XNA 命名色。
                                Colour of the particles and trails. **auto / empty / NONE = the
                                theme highlight colour**; also accepts CustomColor presets and
                                dynamic colours, hex, numeric RGB(A) and XNA names.
       BackgroundCount          基准尺寸下想要的粒子数。留空 = 230。
                                Particle count wanted at the reference size. Empty = 230.
       BackgroundReferenceHeight 基准尺寸（绘制区高度，像素）。留空 = 200。
                                Reference size in pixels (drawing-area height). Empty = 200.
       BackgroundSpeed          基准尺寸下想要的速度（每秒像素）。留空 = 300。
                                Speed wanted at the reference size, in pixels per second. Empty = 300.
       ParticlePixels           粒子与拖尾的线宽（像素）。留空 = 2。
                                Line width of particles and trails. Empty = 2.
       TrailPixels              拖尾基础长度（像素）。留空 = 5。
                                Base trail length. Empty = 5.
       LoadTrailGain            满负荷时拖尾的倍数。留空 = 2.0。
                                Trail multiplier at full load. Empty = 2.0.
       LoadSpeedGain            满负荷时速度的倍数。留空 = 2.6。
                                Speed multiplier at full load. Empty = 2.6. -->
  <BackgroundColor>auto</BackgroundColor>
  <BackgroundCount>230</BackgroundCount>
  <BackgroundReferenceHeight>200</BackgroundReferenceHeight>
  <BackgroundSpeed>300</BackgroundSpeed>
  <ParticlePixels>2</ParticlePixels>
  <TrailPixels>5</TrailPixels>
  <LoadTrailGain>2.0</LoadTrailGain>
  <LoadSpeedGain>2.6</LoadSpeedGain>

</ProxyKillerConfig>

<!--
    ============================================================
    变体 / Variants（把对应行放进上面的根元素）
    Variants (put the line into the root element above)
    ============================================================

    [慢慢爬：看清粒子由乱到稳 / A slow ramp so the dots can be watched]
      <RampRate>8</RampRate>

    [目标拉大、速率不变 / A bigger target, same speed]
      <BurstTarget>600</BurstTarget>

    [三倍速，且很早就到位 / x3, reaching full speed early]
      <BurstTarget>100</BurstTarget>
      <ShellOverloadTarget>3.0</ShellOverloadTarget>

    [只加速一点点，保留原版节奏 / A gentle nudge, keeping the vanilla pace]
      <ShellOverloadTarget>1.2</ShellOverloadTarget>

    [不管加速，只想占内存 / Only here for the RAM footprint]
      <BurstTarget>2048</BurstTarget>
      <ShellOverloadTarget>1.0</ShellOverloadTarget>

    [自己过载：不开 shell 也能削代理，半速 / Self-overload at half the vanilla Shell rate]
      <SelfOverload>0.5</SelfOverload>

    [自己过载：与原版一个 shell 同速 / Self-overload at one vanilla Shell's rate]
      <SelfOverload>1.0</SelfOverload>

    [跟着连接走，离开就关 / Follow the connection, close when you leave]
      <FollowConnection>true</FollowConnection>

    [代理一瘫痪就自动关 / Close as soon as the proxy goes down]
      <AutoCloseOnOverload>true</AutoCloseOnOverload>

    [稀疏：粒子少而尾巴短 / Sparse: fewer particles, shorter trails]
      <BackgroundCount>120</BackgroundCount>
      <TrailPixels>16</TrailPixels>

    [密集：粒子多而尾巴长 / Dense: more particles, longer trails]
      <BackgroundCount>400</BackgroundCount>
      <TrailPixels>45</TrailPixels>

    [想让它更明显（大窗口用）/ Make it chunkier for large windows]
      <ParticlePixels>8</ParticlePixels>
      <TrailPixels>45</TrailPixels>
      <BackgroundSpeed>450</BackgroundSpeed>

    [慢一点、更从容 / Slower, more relaxed]
      <BackgroundSpeed>140</BackgroundSpeed>

    [加速更猛：满负荷 4 倍速 / A harder kick: x4 at full load]
      <LoadSpeedGain>4.0</LoadSpeedGain>

    [跟着主题走 / Follow the theme colour]
      <BackgroundColor>auto</BackgroundColor>

    [换个颜色 / Another colour]
      <BackgroundColor>Rainbow</BackgroundColor>
-->
